# Everything here is generated at runtime by scripts/seed-vpn-mock.sh, and
# config/server/privatekey-server, config/peer1/privatekey-peer1 and
# config/peer1/presharedkey-peer1 are real WireGuard keys. They only ever
# reach a throwaway local endpoint, but a private key should not be
# committable regardless, and without this a `git add -A` after running the
# mock stages all three.
*
!.gitignore
